data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"888\" class=\"\">Hot-swappable SFP+ form factor</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"924\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"924\" class=\"\">Backward compatible with 1GBASE-T</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"953\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"953\" class=\"\">Plug-and-play installation</p>\n</li></ul>\n<p data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1124\" class=\"\">Optimize your high-speed copper networking with the <strong data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1043\">D CORE 10GBASE-T SFP+ RJ45 Module</strong>, ideal for environments where fiber is not practical but 10G speed is essential.</p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Cisco SFP-10G-SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ Module","href":"/cisco-sfp-10g-sr-10gbase-sr-sfp-module","now":"700৳","old":"800৳","single":""},{"name":"Huawei 10G SFP+ Module 850nm (Multi Mode) 0.3km","href":"/huawei-10g-sfp-module-850nm-multi-mode-03km","now":"1,200৳","old":"1,300৳","single":""},{"name":"Fortinet FN-TRAN-SFP+SR 10GBASE-SR SFP+ 850nm 300m SFP Module","href":"/fortinet-fn-tran-sfpsr-10gbase-sr-sfp-850nm-300m-sfp-module","now":"5,500৳","old":"6,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Intel 10G SFP+ 850NM Short Range Module 10GBASE-SR Optical Transceiver","href":"/intel-10g-sfp-850nm-short-range-module-10gbase-sr-optical-transceiver","now":"2,500৳","old":"3,000৳","single":""},{"name":"HPE Aruba 40G QSFP+ LC BiDi 150m MMF SFP Module","href":"/hpe-aruba-40g-qsfp-lc-bidi-150m-mmf-sfp-module","now":"7,000৳","old":"8,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Cisco 40GBASE QSFP-40G-LR4-S 1310nm Single-Mode Duplex SMF LC 10KM SFP Module","href":"/cisco-40gbase-qsfp-40g-lr4-s-1310nm-single-mode-duplex-smf-lc-10km-sfp-module","now":"18,000৳","old":"20,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Fortinet FN-TRAN-SX 1000BASE-SX 850nm 550m MMF SFP Module","href":"/fortinet-fn-tran-sx-1000base-sx-850nm-550m-mmf